ndant argues the FSIA requires specific statutory interpretation."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 24, lines 38-6","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2015/13-1067_f2ah.pdf","page_label":"file page 24, lines 38-6"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 35, lines 10-28","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2015/13-1067_f2ah.pdf","page_label":"file page 35, lines 10-28"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 4, lines 20-44","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2015/13-1067_f2ah.pdf","page_label":"file page 4, lines 20-44"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 58, lines 48-40","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2015/13-1067_f2ah.pdf","page_label":"file page 58, lines 48-40"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 60, lines 40-30","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2015/13-1067_f2ah.pdf","page_label":"file page 60, lines 40-30"}]},{"heading":"What the justices asked","paragraphs":["Justice Kagan asked if the agency question matters if the ticket was not honored.","Justice Kagan asked if the jurisdiction test matches the foreign corporation standard."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 10, lines 30-34","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2015/13-1067_f2ah.pdf","page_label":"file page 10, lines 30-34"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 10, lines 48-10","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2015/13-1067_f2a